# 44. FINAL RULES

```text
RULE 01
Every character must have a unique Character_ID.

RULE 02
First Name may be duplicated.

RULE 03
Commoner normally uses First Name only.

RULE 04
Noble/Royal characters may receive Family Name.

RULE 05
Family Name is generated by Family RNG.

RULE 06
First Name is generated by Name Pool RNG.

RULE 07
Name Pool depends on Race, Gender, Culture,
Region, and Background.

RULE 08
Name duplication is allowed.

RULE 09
Duplicate names do not mean duplicate characters.

RULE 10
Character_ID is the primary identity.

RULE 11
Name does not determine combat power.

RULE 12
Every generated name must pass validation.

RULE 13
Name Pool should support Weight/Rarity.

RULE 14
The system should support future expansion
to additional races, cultures, and regions.
```

